      <main style="max-width: 640px; margin: 3rem auto; padding: 0 1.5rem; font-family: monospace; line-height: 1.6">
        <h1>Mari — AI content management for coding agents</h1>
        <p>
          Your agent wrote the README. Mari checks it against the code. A free Claude Code
          plugin that writes docs from your code, checks every claim against it, and strips
          the AI tells. On-device, no API key. Apache 2.0.
        </p>
        <h2>Install (inside Claude Code)</h2>
        <pre>
/plugin marketplace add MariHQ/mari
/plugin install mari@MariHQ
/mari init</pre>
        <p>
          23 subcommands, a 173-rule deterministic detector, runs in the same turn your agent
          writes. Mari Canon adds an org-wide record: every claim with a source, an owner, and
          a sign-off. Machine-readable summary: <a href="/llms.txt">/llms.txt</a> ·
          <a href="https://github.com/MariHQ/mari-cli">GitHub</a> · <a href="/docs">Docs</a>
        </p>
      </main>
